0.4.0
=====
* Start the Liquidsoap language server: errors as you type, hover, completion,
  signature help, go to definition and document outline
* Format through the language server, falling back to liquidsoap-prettier when
  it cannot start, as in the web version
* Build with esbuild, and bundle separately for the desktop and the web

